    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Casual Roguelite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DeviDevi Survivor&quot; is an action game that combines omnidirectional shooting with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a protagonist who seeks to fulfill wishes using the power of the scales, challenging evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through stage-based adventures, players can enjoy character growth and evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Evolution System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the curse of the scales, the protagonist's body, stats, and character portrait change after clearing each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This evolution system allows players to experience different growth patterns in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/f96eb61370feb7eb15a113786e6abb64.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/f96eb61370feb7eb15a113786e6abb64.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/f96eb61370feb7eb15a113786e6abb64.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Skills and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different skills are available, and players can choose random skills when leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows players to build their own ultimate character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine skills to develop various tactics and face hordes of evil spirits approaching from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story branches based on changes in the protagonist's body type, leading to different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each growth phase has dedicated event scenes, allowing players to enjoy story developments according to their chosen growth pattern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's body type at the time of game completion is directly reflected in the ending scene, allowing for a more immersive conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/7c2e8d4028c1d4fa6d448aed57e272d2.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/7c2e8d4028c1d4fa6d448aed57e272d2.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/7c2e8d4028c1d4fa6d448aed57e272d2.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bBy clearing &quot;Normal&quot; difficulty, you can unlock the archive function that allows you to view all scene animations and body variations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Casual Roguelite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DeviDevi Survivor&quot; is an action game that combines omnidirectional shooting with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a protagonist who seeks to fulfill wishes using the power of the scales, challenging evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through stage-based adventures, players can enjoy character growth and evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/b013407f766af5f575261946b5a995a0.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Evolution System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the curse of the scales, the protagonist's body, stats, and character portrait change after clearing each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This evolution system allows players to experience different growth patterns in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/f96eb61370feb7eb15a113786e6abb64.poster.avif?t=1745476639\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/f96eb61370feb7eb15a113786e6abb64.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app