height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/7c2e8d4028c1d4fa6d448aed57e272d2.webm?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159800/extras/7c2e8d4028c1d4fa6d448aed57e272d2.mp4?t=1745476639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bBy clearing &quot;Normal&quot; difficulty, you can unlock the archive function that allows you to view all scene animations and body variations.</p>",
